# --- Re-include bundled app assets that the parent (TyDez) .gitignore would exclude ---
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores `assets/`, `*.mp4`, `*.wav`; those are meant for
# the Python video project at the root, not for this bundled web app.
!assets/
!docs/assets/
!public/assets/
!**/assets/
!**/*.mp4
!**/*.wav
